  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoration and connectivity of priority habitats for species conservation in Serbia (KBF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to restore degraded old-growth forests, wetlands, and grasslands while enhancing ecological connectivity through innovative, participatory approaches. Vulnerable pilot sites will be assessed to guide tailored restoration measures such as reforestation and wetlands rewetting, implemented via a competitive Challenge Call involving stakeholders to promote employment, skills development, and women&#x2019;s leadership. Legal, regulatory, and financial frameworks will be updated to align wit</narrative>
  </description>
